{"id":"23a366010a806e088af6caac49bc5744d9d4a113","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/58067","title":"刚刚，首个千万级AI创作大赛开启！一个人一部片，独拿200万 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"新智元\n                  2026-09-18 15:50 分享","excerpt":"AI超创DiDi_OK的短片《网站》在2026年威尼斯Reply AI Film Festival斩获双奖，从76国3100余部作品中脱颖而出，获奥斯卡得主及《狮子王》联合导演等权威评委认可。影片以惊艳视觉与深刻叙事见长，十余分钟探讨“观看能否改变现实”这一哲思命题，通过地铁奶牛、灭绝大海雀、冲向风车等超现实意象，展现AI影像对现实认知与社会反思的突破性表达。（150字）","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ded09a682583e32d3aebf9491767947e1789717801278.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.42643923240938164\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2345\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"246\" data-imgfileid=\"505243195\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ded09a682583e32d3aebf9491767947e1789717801278.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section></h3><h3><section data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\"><p><span><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p></section></h3><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">就在十天前，一部</span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\">AI</span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">短片，在整个</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\">AI</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">圈炸了。</span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">AI</span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">超创</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\">DiDi_OK</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">的《网站》，在</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\">2026</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">年威尼斯</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\">Reply AI Film Festival</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">上拿了双料大奖。</span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">76</span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">个国家、</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\">3100</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">多部作品里杀出来，评委阵容里坐着奥斯卡得主和《狮子王》联合导演。</span></SPAN></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0a264c068c6a7c61e32f7d16e1dbc2e21789717801279.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.090289608177172\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1174\" data-width=\"1174\" data-height=\"1280\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"613\" data-imgfileid=\"505243190\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0a264c068c6a7c61e32f7d16e1dbc2e21789717801279.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">它能脱颖而出，除了凭借画面的惊艳，还有在叙事上的深厚功力。</span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">十来分钟，就讲一个问题：观看，能不能改变现实？地铁里的奶牛、灭绝的大海雀、冲向风车的堂吉诃德，最后全汇进一个长着眼睛的「网站」。</span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">《网站》成为本届唯一一部既拿到评审大奖又获得观众选择奖的作品，评委和观众一致性地投出了这一票。</span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">而这种会讲故事的</span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\">AI</span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">创作者，正是整个当下</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\">AI</span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\">行业最稀缺、宝贵的人才。</span></SPAN></p><section><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">就在今天，虎鲸文娱集团正式启动「虎鲸</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">人才计划」，同步推出「鲸锐</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作大赛」。</span></span></SPAN></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"316\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"2160\" data-imgfileid=\"505243192\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50bd466903377c447249a4dea8a7bff11789717801279.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"3840\" data-width=\"3840\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50bd466903377c447249a4dea8a7bff11789717801279.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这是国内首个总奖金池达1000万的AI视频创作大赛，最高单项奖200万元。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">你没看错，200万。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">一个人，一部AI作品，200万现金。</span></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789717801279.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789717801279.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">1000万现金大奖</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">单奖最高200万</span></strong></span></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">先说个数字，你就知道这</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">1000</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万意味着什么。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">今年上半年，抖音</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作大赛总奖金池</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">400</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万，已经被圈内称为「天花板级别」。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">B</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">站年初的</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作大赛，奖金总计</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">300</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万出头。上海国际电影节</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AIGC</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">单元、北京国际电影节</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">电影季，奖金规模也都在百万量级上下。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">而鲸锐</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作大赛，总奖金池为</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">1000</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">千万奖池，钱怎么分？</span></span></SPAN></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">先看最高奖——鲸锐人才奖，1名，200万元。</span></span></strong></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">对一个独立创作者、小型工作室来说，</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">200</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万足够让接下来的创作计划多出不少想象空间。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">升级制作条件、邀请伙伴加入，或者给下一部作品留出更充足的打磨时间，都有了认真考虑的余地。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">再往下，还有一组值得圈出来的数字：</span><span textstyle=\"\">最具原创</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">IP</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">奖，</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">4</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">名，每人</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">50</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万元</span><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">为什么单独拿出</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">200</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万，奖励原创</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">IP</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">？</span></span></SPAN></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">看</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这些经久不衰的影视作品就知道了。</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">片子结束，观众还惦记里面的人物，想知道他们接下来会遇到什么。甚至一个配角、一处尚未展开的伏笔，都能让人催更。</span></span></SPAN></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这就是一个原创世界继续生长的可能。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这四个奖项，重点奖励具备进一步开发潜力的优质</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">IP</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">你交出一部完整作品，也可以让评委看到，这个故事，后面还有得讲。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">接下来，四大单项奖各设</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">5</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">名，每名</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">10</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">万元，一共</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">20</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">个名额：</span></span></SPAN></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">最佳创意表达奖、最佳叙事结构奖、最具视觉效果奖、最佳角色塑造奖。</span></span></p></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这组奖项很有意思，擅长讲悬疑，可以在叙事上发力；擅长设计人物，可以让一个角色留在观众心里。有独特的视觉风格，同样有对应的奖项。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作者不必把所有精力都堆在「看起来很贵」的镜头上。一个精彩的设定、一段层层推进的故事，也值得被看见。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">而容易被忽略的，是40个新锐创作者奖，每个5万元；200个潜力创作者奖，每个1万元。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5a88cd79943badc30ee1fb396fa316961789717801279.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.3333333333333333\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"1440\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"749\" data-imgfileid=\"505243189\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5a88cd79943badc30ee1fb396fa316961789717801279.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">265个获奖名额铺下来，就是让大量创作者觉得「值得认真试一次」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">一句话总结这个奖金结构，头部重赏、腰部托举、底部普惠。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">不管你是单枪匹马的独立创作者，还是有班底的小团队，都能在这张奖金网里找到自己的位置。</span></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789717801279.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789717801279.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">「寻找最会讲故事的AI创作者」</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">看到这里，你可能以为这是一个单纯比拼AI技术的赛事。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">当然不是！</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">大赛的参赛要求里，藏着一条意味深长的规定——</span></span></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">参赛视频时长不少于10分钟。</span></span></p></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">10</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">分钟不是门槛，是给故事留的空间。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">几十秒够秀一个镜头；</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">10</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">分钟，才够一个人物出场、遇到麻烦、做出选择。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">它筛的不是「能不能做长」，是「有没有故事」。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">参赛不限</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作工具、不限题材、个人或团队均可。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">唯一的硬性要求是：原创，有完整的故事，不得使用现有</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">IP</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">大赛还要求参赛者提交一份</span></span></SPAN></span><b><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">不少于</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">1000</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">字的故事阐述</span></span></SPAN></span></b><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，你把故事的逻辑、主题、人物动机讲清楚。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这说明在大赛的评审维度里，「故事」和「叙事」的权重，至少和「视觉效果」平起平坐。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这个定位，恰恰踩在了当下</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">视频行业最痛的那根神经上。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">回看《网站》，融合了</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">3D</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">辅助制作、虚拟网页搭建、多模型</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">配合。但核心，是对「观看如何改变现实」这个命题的思考。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><p><b><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">工具可以迭代，模型可以升级，但「讲故事」这件事，永远需要人。</span></span></SPAN></span></b></p><p><span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">鲸锐</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作大赛在做的事，就是在</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">视频产业狂飙突进的</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">2026</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">年，把聚光灯从「工具」移到「人」身上。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789717801279.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789717801279.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">大赛成为一张「入场券」</span></strong></span></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">如果鲸锐</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">创作大赛是一场比赛，那虎鲸</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">人才计划则是要种下一片森林。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">大赛有一条规则：</span></span></SPAN><b><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">入围初选的创作者，即可加入「虎鲸</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">人才计划」。</span></span></SPAN></b></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这意味着，奖金不是终点，而是起点。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">入围者将获得的不只是钱，还有一整套成长资源——</span></span></p><ul><li><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">「大师面对面」活动，国内外知名编剧导演现场指导；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI创作行业沙龙、AI创作领域专家分享交流；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">线上线下展映会，给创作者搭建被「看见」的舞台。</span></span></p></li></ul><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">尤其是「大师面对面」这个环节</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">解决的便是当下</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">视频创作者群体一个普遍的困境：技术敏感度极高，但影视叙事训练严重不足。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">很多人能把画面做到惊艳绝伦，但一开口可能就会出现逻辑断裂、人物扁平的问题。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这不是他们不努力，而是他们压根没有机会接受专业的叙事训练。</span></span></SPAN></p><section><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">让这些</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">原生创作者和真正的影视大师坐在一起对话，等于是在给一群最擅长驾驭新工具的年轻人，补上一堂最稀缺的「故事课」。</span></span></SPAN></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">对于那些还未得到专业影视训练的AI创作者来说，这可能是他们第一次站到影视行业的专业评审面前。</span></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789717801279.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789717801279.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">托举有创造力的人：</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">虎鲸文娱的人才逻辑</span></strong></span></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">你可能会问：虎鲸文娱为什么要做这件事？</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">答案藏在它过去几年的动作里。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">过去三年，虎鲸文娱陆续推出「春苗编剧计划」「海纳国际青年导演计划」「虎鲸超越班」三大人才计划，分别面向影视行业的「编导演」人才铁三角。</span></span></SPAN></p><section><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">以春苗编剧计划为例，自</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">2024</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">年推出至今，已服务创作者超</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">3000</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">人，孵化</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">20</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">个涵盖悬疑、现实主义、爱情等多元题材的剧本进入前期开发阶段。</span></span></SPAN></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3a6b1db70d4ec89eb8fb2069a7e7f7a21789717801280.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"4000\" data-width=\"4000\" data-height=\"2250\" data-imgfileid=\"505243191\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3a6b1db70d4ec89eb8fb2069a7e7f7a21789717801280.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">现在，「鲸锐AI创作大赛」和「虎鲸AI人才计划」的推出，等于在这个铁三角旁边，立起了第四根柱子——</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI内容创作者</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这是一个全新的物种。他们不是编剧，不是导演，也不是演员，但他们正在用全新的工具重新定义「内容」这个词。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">虎鲸文娱要做的，是在这个物种刚刚崛起的窗口期，用千万级的资源把他们接住。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">镜头拉远一点。</span></span></SPAN><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">2026</span></span><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">年，</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"Arial\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"等线\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">视频生成行业正处在一个微妙的分水岭上。</span></span></SPAN></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">国产工具则以惊人的速度崛起，各显神通。工具端的竞争已经白热化，但内容端的竞争才刚刚开始。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">下一个用AI讲出惊人故事的人，也许现在正坐在某个出租屋里，手边只有一台电脑。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">他需要的，不过是一个被认真对待的机会、一个值得全力以赴的舞台，和一笔值得一搏的奖金。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这恰恰是鲸锐AI创作大赛正在提供的东西。</span></span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">1000万奖金，265个获奖名额。报名截止日期：11月22日。</span></span></strong></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">如果你手里有一个故事，一直在等一个「值得认真做一次」的理由——它来了。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">点击下方【阅读原文】链接，了解更多大赛相关信息。</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">编辑：所罗门 桃子</span></span></p><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789717801280.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789717801280.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789717801280.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"355\" data-imgfileid=\"505229036\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789717801280.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/486d0628e0a5602d518991256ebf70691789717801280.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.4\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"809\" data-imgfileid=\"505242176\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/486d0628e0a5602d518991256ebf70691789717801280.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 就在十天前，一部AI短片，在整个AI圈炸了。AI超创DiDi_OK的《网站》，在2026年威尼斯Reply AI Film Festival上拿了双料大奖。76个国家、3100多部作品里杀出来，评委阵容里坐着奥斯卡得主和《狮子王》联合导演。它能脱颖而出，除了凭借画面的惊艳，还有在叙事上的深厚功力。十来分钟，就讲一个问题：观看，能不能改变现实？地铁里的奶牛、灭绝的大海雀、冲向风车的堂吉诃德，最后全汇进一个长着眼睛的「网站」。《网站》成为本届唯一一部既拿到评审大奖又获得观众选择奖的作品，评委和观众一致性地投出了这一票。而这种会讲故事的AI创作者，正是整个当下AI行业最稀缺、宝贵的人才。就在今天，虎鲸文娱集团正式启动「虎鲸AI人才计划」，同步推出「鲸锐AI创作大赛」。这是国内首个总奖金池达1000万的AI视频创作大赛，最高单项奖200万元。你没看错，200万。一个人，一部AI作品，200万现金。1000万现金大奖单奖最高200万先说个数字，你就知道这1000万意味着什么。今年上半年，抖音AI创作大赛总奖金池400万，已经被圈内称为「天花板级别」。B站年初的AI创作大赛，奖金总计300万出头。上海国际电影节AIGC单元、北京国际电影节AI电影季，奖金规模也都在百万量级上下。而鲸锐AI创作大赛，总奖金池为1000万。千万奖池，钱怎么分？先看最高奖——鲸锐人才奖，1名，200万元。对一个独立创作者、小型工作室来说，200万足够让接下来的创作计划多出不少想象空间。升级制作条件、邀请伙伴加入，或者给下一部作品留出更充足的打磨时间，都有了认真考虑的余地。再往下，还有一组值得圈出来的数字：最具原创IP奖，4名，每人50万元。为什么单独拿出200万，奖励原创IP？看这些经久不衰的影视作品就知道了。片子结束，观众还惦记里面的人物，想知道他们接下来会遇到什么。甚至一个配角、一处尚未展开的伏笔，都能让人催更。这就是一个原创世界继续生长的可能。这四个奖项，重点奖励具备进一步开发潜力的优质IP。你交出一部完整作品，也可以让评委看到，这个故事，后面还有得讲。接下来，四大单项奖各设5名，每名10万元，一共20个名额：最佳创意表达奖、最佳叙事结构奖、最具视觉效果奖、最佳角色塑造奖。这组奖项很有意思，擅长讲悬疑，可以在叙事上发力；擅长设计人物，可以让一个角色留在观众心里。有独特的视觉风格，同样有对应的奖项。创作者不必把所有精力都堆在「看起来很贵」的镜头上。一个精彩的设定、一段层层推进的故事，也值得被看见。而容易被忽略的，是40个新锐创作者奖，每个5万元；200个潜力创作者奖，每个1万元。265个获奖名额铺下来，就是让大量创作者觉得「值得认真试一次」。一句话总结这个奖金结构，头部重赏、腰部托举、底部普惠。不管你是单枪匹马的独立创作者，还是有班底的小团队，都能在这张奖金网里找到自己的位置。「寻找最会讲故事的AI创作者」看到这里，你可能以为这是一个单纯比拼AI技术的赛事。当然不是！大赛的参赛要求里，藏着一条意味深长的规定——参赛视频时长不少于10分钟。10分钟不是门槛，是给故事留的空间。几十秒够秀一个镜头；10分钟，才够一个人物出场、遇到麻烦、做出选择。它筛的不是「能不能做长」，是「有没有故事」。参赛不限AI创作工具、不限题材、个人或团队均可。唯一的硬性要求是：原创，有完整的故事，不得使用现有IP。大赛还要求参赛者提交一份不少于1000字的故事阐述，你把故事的逻辑、主题、人物动机讲清楚。这说明在大赛的评审维度里，「故事」和「叙事」的权重，至少和「视觉效果」平起平坐。这个定位，恰恰踩在了当下AI视频行业最痛的那根神经上。回看《网站》，融合了3D辅助制作、虚拟网页搭建、多模型AI配合。但核心，是对「观看如何改变现实」这个命题的思考。工具可以迭代，模型可以升级，但「讲故事」这件事，永远需要人。鲸锐AI创作大赛在做的事，就是在AI视频产业狂飙突进的2026年，把聚光灯从「工具」移到「人」身上。大赛成为一张「入场券」如果鲸锐AI创作大赛是一场比赛，那虎鲸AI人才计划则是要种下一片森林。大赛有一条规则：入围初选的创作者，即可加入「虎鲸AI人才计划」。这意味着，奖金不是终点，而是起点。入围者将获得的不只是钱，还有一整套成长资源——「大师面对面」活动，国内外知名编剧导演现场指导；AI创作行业沙龙、AI创作领域专家分享交流；线上线下展映会，给创作者搭建被「看见」的舞台。尤其是「大师面对面」这个环节，解决的便是当下AI视频创作者群体一个普遍的困境：技术敏感度极高，但影视叙事训练严重不足。很多人能把画面做到惊艳绝伦，但一开口可能就会出现逻辑断裂、人物扁平的问题。这不是他们不努力，而是他们压根没有机会接受专业的叙事训练。让这些AI原生创作者和真正的影视大师坐在一起对话，等于是在给一群最擅长驾驭新工具的年轻人，补上一堂最稀缺的「故事课」。对于那些还未得到专业影视训练的AI创作者来说，这可能是他们第一次站到影视行业的专业评审面前。托举有创造力的人：虎鲸文娱的人才逻辑你可能会问：虎鲸文娱为什么要做这件事？答案藏在它过去几年的动作里。过去三年，虎鲸文娱陆续推出「春苗编剧计划」「海纳国际青年导演计划」「虎鲸超越班」三大人才计划，分别面向影视行业的「编导演」人才铁三角。以春苗编剧计划为例，自2024年推出至今，已服务创作者超3000人，孵化20个涵盖悬疑、现实主义、爱情等多元题材的剧本进入前期开发阶段。现在，「鲸锐AI创作大赛」和「虎鲸AI人才计划」的推出，等于在这个铁三角旁边，立起了第四根柱子——AI内容创作者。这是一个全新的物种。他们不是编剧，不是导演，也不是演员，但他们正在用全新的工具重新定义「内容」这个词。虎鲸文娱要做的，是在这个物种刚刚崛起的窗口期，用千万级的资源把他们接住。镜头拉远一点。2026年，AI视频生成行业正处在一个微妙的分水岭上。国产工具则以惊人的速度崛起，各显神通。工具端的竞争已经白热化，但内容端的竞争才刚刚开始。下一个用AI讲出惊人故事的人，也许现在正坐在某个出租屋里，手边只有一台电脑。他需要的，不过是一个被认真对待的机会、一个值得全力以赴的舞台，和一笔值得一搏的奖金。这恰恰是鲸锐AI创作大赛正在提供的东西。1000万奖金，265个获奖名额。报名截止日期：11月22日。如果你手里有一个故事，一直在等一个「值得认真做一次」的理由——它来了。点击下方【阅读原文】链接，了解更多大赛相关信息。编辑：所罗门 桃子秒追ASI⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-09-19T10:20:57.269Z","ok":true}